    hover {
        summary {Forces the document to be cached.}
        synopsis {CACHE::enable}
        description {Forces the document to be cached. You can also use this command to
cache non-GET requests.

Note: Should be used with extreme caution, as it allows caching of content marked private by server.

CACHE::enable

     * Forces the document to be cached.}
        source {https://clouddocs.f5.com/api/irules/CACHE__enable.html}
        example {when HTTP_REQUEST {
  if { [HTTP::uri] contains "images" } {
    CACHE::enable
  }
}}
    }
}

