        summary {Get mime type and mime subtype of payload.}
        synopsis {CATEGORY::filetype HTTP_PAYLOAD}
        description {Checks for the mime type and mime subtype of an HTTP request payload and returns the values to specified variables; use one or both to specify them name of the variable that you want the value to be given to.}
        source {https://clouddocs.f5.com/api/irules/CATEGORY__filetype.html}
