        summary {Gets (v11.0+) or sets (v11.1+) simple bits or byte fields.}
        synopsis {DNS::header <field> ?value?}
        synopsis {DNS::header id ?UNSIGNED_SHORT?}
        synopsis {DNS::header rcode ?RCODE_VALUE?}
        description {This iRules command gets or sets simple bits or byte fields. Read-only
form introduced in v11.0, Read-write capability added in v11.1.

Note: This command requires the DNS Profile, which is only enabled as
part of GTM or the DNS Services add-on.}
