Valid values for version are 1 or 2 only.
Request-type: A value less than 256.
Returns a TCL object of type "GTP-Message"}
        source {https://clouddocs.f5.com/api/irules/GTP__new.html}
        example {when CLIENT_ACCEPTED {
    set t2 [GTP::new 2 10]
