        summary {Changes the HTTP2 filter from full parsing to passthrough mode.}
        synopsis {HTTP2::disable ('clientside')? ('serverside')? ('discard')?}
        description {Changes the HTTP2 filter from full parsing to passthrough mode. This
command is useful when using an HTTP2 profile with an application that
