        description {Releases the data collected via HTTP::collect. Unless a subsequent
HTTP::collect command was issued, there is no need to use the
HTTP::release command inside of the HTTP_REQUEST_DATA and
HTTP_RESPONSE_DATA events, since (in these cases) the data is
implicitly released.
It is important to note that these semantics are different than those
of the TCP::collect and TCP::release commands.}
        source {https://clouddocs.f5.com/api/irules/HTTP__release.html}
        example {when CLIENT_ACCEPTED {
