        synopsis {PEM::flow transactional disable}
        synopsis {PEM::flow eval}
        description {The transciontal disable command disables the transactional feature in PEM for a flow.
The eval command trigers the policy evaluation for the flow immediately.}
        source {https://clouddocs.f5.com/api/irules/PEM__flow.html}
        example {when HTTP_REQUEST {
    PEM::flow transactional disable;
    PEM::flow eval;
}}
