        description {Sends an RTSP response to the client. The return value of the
RTSP::msg_source command must be client. When an iRule responds to an
RTSP request, the RTSP filter performs no further processing on the
request and will not send the RTSP request to the server.
A maximum of one response is allowed per RTSP request.}
        source {https://clouddocs.f5.com/api/irules/RTSP__respond.html}
        example {when RTSP_REQUEST {
        RTSP::respond 401 Unauthorized "x-header\r\n\r\n  Hey, you need a password"
    }}
    }
}

