        synopsis {SCTP::collect (COLLECT_BYTES)?}
        description {Causes SCTP to start collecting the specified amount of content data. After collecting the data, event CLIENT_DATA will be triggered.

SCTP::collect <length>
    Causes SCTP to start collecting the specified amount of content data. The parameter specifies the minimum number of bytes to collect.

SCTP::collect
    When length is not specified, CLIENT_DATA will be triggered for every received packet. To stop collecting data, use SCTP::release.}
        source {https://clouddocs.f5.com/api/irules/SCTP__collect.html}
        example {when CLIENT_ACCEPTED {
  SCTP::collect 15
}}
    }
}

