        summary {Returns or replaces SCTP data content.}
        synopsis {SCTP::payload ( (PAYLOAD_LENGTH) |}
        description {Returns the accumulated SCTP data content, or replaces collected payload with the specified data.

SCTP::payload [<number_of_bytes>]
    Returns the accumulated SCTP payload data content upto size bytes if provided.

SCTP::payload <offset> <number_of_bytes>
    Returns upto number_of_bytes bytes of the accumulated SCTP payload data content starting from the offset provided.

SCTP::payload replace <offset> <length> <data>
    Replaces collected payload data with the given data, starting at offset.

SCTP::payload length
    Returns the amount of accumulated SCTP data content in bytes.}
        source {https://clouddocs.f5.com/api/irules/SCTP__payload.html}
        example {when CLIENT_ACCEPTED {
