        source {https://clouddocs.f5.com/api/irules/SSL__handshake.html}
        example {when AUTH_ERROR {
    if {$auth_ldap_sid eq [AUTH::last_event_session_id]} {
        reject
    }
}}
        returns {SSL::handshake hold Halts any SSL activity. Typically used when an authentication request is made.}
    }
}

