        example {when CLIENTSSL_CLIENTHELLO {
                if { [SSL::secure_renegotiation] != 2 } {
                    SSL::secure_renegotiation require-strict
                }
            }}
        returns {The getter returns the flow's current Secure Renegotiation mode: zero for request, one for require, or two for require-strict. The request, require, and require-strict arguments set the mode for subsequent SSL handshakes on the flow.}
