        summary {Set/Get the TCP Keep-Alive Interval.}
        synopsis {TCP::keepalive (KEEP_ALIVE_INTERVAL)?}
        description {Sets or gets the number of seconds before BIG-IP sends a keep-alive packet on a TCP connection with no traffic. A value of zero indicates no keep-alive packet should be sent.}
        source {https://clouddocs.f5.com/api/irules/TCP__keepalive.html}
        example {when SERVER_CONNECTED {
