        summary {Returns the VLAN tag of the packet.}
        synopsis {vlan_id}
        description {Returns the VLAN tag of the packet. This is a BIG-IP 4.X variable,
provided for backward-compatibility. You can use the equivalent 9.X
command LINK::vlan_id instead.}
